Vice versa. I tried to produce an absurd analogy. "," is 
syllable/diphtong separator. It's pretty nonsensical (IMHO) to try to 
separate something from something which does not exist.

The pause is exactly the same kind of nonsense -- you have to add a 
pause after a name anyway, so adding TWO pauses would be .. well, nonsense.


